    "name": "luh-micro-topo",
    "notes": "This dataset contains microscopic RGB-D measurements of various topographies.\r\nThe data was acquired using a Keyence VK-X210 confocal laser scanning microscope.\r\nA CSV file contains the metadata for all measurements, while the raw data for each measurement is stored as an npy file. Furthermore, each measurement contains the following:\r\n* a height image\r\n* a laser intensity image\r\n* an RGB image\r\n* a combined laser intensity + RGB image.\r\nLastly, display_dataset.ipynb is included as a demo to load the CSV and display measurement data.",
